# Iris & Titanic ML Project

A classification project using the Iris flower dataset and the Titanic survival dataset.

## Datasets
- `data/iris_50.csv` — 50 samples, 4 features, 3 classes (`setosa`, `versicolor`, `virginica`)
- `data/titanic_50.csv` — 50 samples, 8 features, binary target `Survived`

## Algorithms
- Decision Tree
- k-Nearest Neighbors (k-NN)
- Random Forest (Iris)
- Logistic Regression (Titanic)

## Project Structure
- `src/data_loader.py` — load datasets
- `src/preprocessing.py` — cleaning, scaling, splitting
- `src/feature_selection.py` — correlation & mutual information
- `src/model_evaluation.py` — metrics & confusion matrix
- `src/iris_classifier.py` — Iris pipeline
- `src/titanic_classifier.py` — Titanic pipeline
- `main.py` — runs both pipelines

## How to Run
```bash
pip install -r requirements.txt
python main.py